<div n="1"><head><hi rendition="#aq">III.</hi></head><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#in">E</hi>ine viel tiefere Wunde hat uns die<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Gallicomanie</hi> (<hi rendition="#g">Franzo&#x017F;en</hi>-<hi rendition="#g">Sucht</hi><lb/>
